+## Usage reported to afterModelResponse
+
+- `afterModelResponse` receives the summed `inputTokens`, `outputTokens`, and `totalTokens` across every provider call in the turn when a turn runs tool rounds ([validated by: reports the sum of three provider calls when a turn runs two tool rounds](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L13)).
