+- Rounds that report no usage are omitted from the sum without turning any total into `undefined` or `NaN`, and a turn where no round reported usage hands `undefined` to `afterModelResponse` ([validated by: counts the rounds that reported usage when one round reports none, and reports nothing when no round did](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L32)).
